# Wetlands (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Wetlands: 1 quest on key 1437
# (docs/wetlands-horde-census.md). 95682 accepts from and turns in to
# the Deathstalker Agent at his single Wetlands spawn; its pre 95663
# turns in at the same agent in the Arathi (Horde) route. The 5 shared
# writs stay with the ungated main guide. All three objective sources
# are unplaced in the data - no invented points.
guide butler-routes-completionist/wetlands-horde
title Wetlands (Horde)
levels 24-31
zone Wetlands
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step The Deathstalker Agent - Open the Maw

  zone map 1437

  note The Deathstalker Agent works the wetlands east of Menethil. Take 95682 after 95663 (Dragonmaw Rumors) - its turn-in rides in arathi-horde.guide at this same agent.
  accept 95682 -- Open the Maw - the Deathstalker Agent @51.41,59.23; two Dragonmaw Saboteurs, four Dragonmaw Warders, and the Dragonmaw Dispatch
  note The Saboteurs, the Warders and the Dispatch's dropper (a Dragonmaw Thaumaturgist) have no placed spawns in the data - work the Dragonmaw camp for all seven and the dispatch; have them in hand for the turn-in.
  turnin 95682 -- Open the Maw - the hunt and the dispatch to the Deathstalker Agent @51.41,59.23
